# Privacy guard: untracked film media must remain local/private. Git ignores do
# not affect already-tracked files, revoke public history, or prevent `git add -f`.
# Review provenance and permissions before intentionally tracking any asset.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
# ...except the CC BY 3.0 face-scan colour map, which is source data for the
# close-ups, not film media. Without it the checkouts render flat grey skin and
# nobody can tell why: it is how the map went missing in the first place.
!assets/face-scan/Map-COL.jpg
*.webp
*.gif
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.flac
*.zip
/private-*-output/
/*-output/
/PRIVATE-CONTINUATION-NOTES.md

# V8 build tooling: environment, downloaded models, renders and logs stay local
/qc/.env
/qc/models/
/qc/out/
__pycache__/
/render-v8/
